      <span class="closing-cta-row"><span class="closing-cta-key">Téléphone</span> <a href="tel:+33428390334">04 28 39 03 34</a></span>
      <span class="closing-cta-row"><span class="closing-cta-key">Site</span> <a href="https://www.buildy.fr">www.buildy.fr</a></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</body>
</html>
